Now Hiring: Business Development Manager – AI Infrastructure & Embodied Intelligence (South & West Zone, China)

The build-out of AI compute capacity and the industrialization of robots are reshaping manufacturing lines across China. AI servers, liquid-cooling racks, UPS and the broader data center supply chain are scaling up fast, while humanoid robots and embodied intelligence move from prototypes toward series production.

Atlas Copco Industrial Technique — a Swedish industrial brand with more than 150 years of expertise in smart tightening and assembly automation — is opening a dedicated Business Development Manager role in our General Industry South & West Zone to grow the AI Infrastructure and Embodied Intelligence segments.

What you will do:
- Drive revenue growth and new business development for the AI Infrastructure and Embodied Intelligence segments in South & West China;
- Conduct market analysis, map target customers — both machine tool builders / automation integrators (MTB) and end users — and build measurable action plans;
- Visit customers together with the local sales team, identify production and assembly pain points, propose suitable tightening, automation, error-proofing and traceability solutions, and support quotation, negotiation, contract signing and execution follow-up;
- Collaborate with the division headquarters, other customer centers and the local innovation center to build segment-specific solutions and ecosystem partnerships;
- Coach the sales team and share industry know-how to build overall capability.

What we are looking for:
- Bachelor degree or above in engineering, automation, mechatronics or software;
- At least 3 years of sales or business development experience in data centers / AI servers, robotics, electronics or automotive electronics; experience with MTB or automation equipment integrators is a strong plus;
- A working understanding of mechanics, electricals, automation or software, and familiarity with manufacturing methods and industry trends;
- Key account development, presentation, negotiation, coaching and influence skills; fluent written and spoken English;
- A growth mindset, proactive attitude, customer focus, drive, competitiveness and strong energy in a fast-moving market.


This is a role at the intersection of two high-growth tracks, backed by a global leading assembly-solutions platform, cross-region resources and an established product ecosystem.
If this matches your next career move, or if you know someone who could be a fit, please send the CV to alex.zhao@atlascopco.com with the position title in the subject line. Like and share are appreciated 🌐
